{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27178","headline":"题崔中丞北斋 · 郑巢","name":"题崔中丞北斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖近草侵庭，秋来道兴生。\n寒潮添井味，远漏带松声。\n放卷听泉坐，寻僧踏雪行。\n何年各无事，高论宿青城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑巢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}